        "calls": 1,
        "title": "Active time metering replaces wall clock for sponsored compute grants",
        "summary": "Sponsored compute grants in the common ads package now use a 90-minute active time budget instead of a 60-minute wall clock window, preventing expiration during user pauses. The new `sponsoredActiveMsAfterCall` function caps individual call gaps at 5 minutes, and a new `SPONSORED_AWAITING_USER_STATE` constant defines the report sent when a run is parked on the user. This change corrects a historical failure mode where about 121 Desktop runs a week expired at exactly 60 minutes while waiting on a user. The failure explanation module also recognizes the new 'turn grant-expired' diagnostic string to surface the correct user-facing reason.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "operators",
        "evidence": "In `common/src/ads/sponsored-compute-contract.ts`, `SPONSORED_COMPUTE_ACTIVE_WINDOW_MS` is defined as `90 * 60_000` and `SPONSORED_COMPUTE_RUN_WINDOW_MS` is deprecated and aliased to it; in `common/src/ads/sponsored-run-failure.ts`, `sponsoredFailureExplanation` adds a check for `text.startsWith('turn grant-expired')` to map it to 'The compute grant expired.'",
        "userVisible": false,
        "confidence": "medium",
        "unknowns": "The diff does not show the server-side implementation that actually meters active time or the API route that accepts the new state reports.",
        "changes": [
          {
            "area": "Shared/Core",
            "what": "Replaced the 60-minute wall clock limit with a 90-minute active time budget, capping inter-call gaps at 5 minutes and adding a mechanism to pause the clock while the user is away.",
            "files": [
              "common/src/ads/sponsored-compute-contract.ts"
            ]
          },
          {
            "area": "Shared/Core",
            "what": "Updated the stale sweep deadline calculation to respect user-parked states and to meter active time from the most recent activity rather than the initial start time.",
            "files": [
              "common/src/ads/sponsored-compute-contract.ts"
            ]
          },
          {
            "area": "Shared/Core",
            "what": "Added a new check in the failure explanation logic to identify and report 'turn grant-expired' diagnostics as a specific compute grant expiration event.",
            "files": [
              "common/src/ads/sponsored-run-failure.ts"
            ]
          }
        ],
